<title>USA: U.S. Trust Corp Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>U.S. Trust Corp Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.05   profit	 $0.89</p>
<p> Net profit		11,241   profit	 9,146</p>
<p> Total fee revs	  63,600		   56,600</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $3.83     loss	 $5.24</p>
<p> Net profit		40,904     loss	50,521</p>
<p> Total fee revs	 244,200		  215,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 net interest revenue after provision for credit losses was $20.2 million vs $17.3 million, and for year $77.9 million vs $96.9 million.</p>
<p>1995 year results reflect sale of company's securities processing business on September 1, 1995, and related restructuring expenses of $86.9 million after tax, or $9.05 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
